From: Jorijn van der Graaf <jorijnvdgraaf@catcrafts.net>
Subject: dt-bindings: iio: light: stk33xx: document the Sensortek STK36C61
Source: https://lists.openwall.net/linux-kernel/2026/09/01/114
Message-ID: <20260901005114.203062-3-jorijnvdgraaf@catcrafts.net>

Documentation-only adaptation of the public v3 2/5 patch to pinned63289f.
It validates the existing FP6 compatible/fallback; it does not fix probe-EIO,
change a driver, activate a sensor or alter the verified645 kernel.

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/stk33xx.yaml
